  "body": "## What\n\nRemoves \"buy or inspect a physical copy\" from the corpus as a category of\nrequestable evidence, and stops future passes from re-raising it.\n\nT's decision: physical-copy acquisition is out of scope. These asks can never\nbe satisfied, so they accumulate as permanent open work items that read like\npending tasks.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **`OKF_SPEC.md`** \u2014 new \"No physical-acquisition followups\" section under the\n  followups contract. A followup must name a *document source* that could be\n  retrieved (URL, archive capture, official scan/readout, licensed corpus).\n  Asks to buy, borrow, unbox, or physically inspect a copy are prohibited \u2014 as\n  a `physical://` pseudo-URL, as prose \"residual help\", or as an `intake-gap`\n  issue line. Box/SKU/UPC/lot/printing-marker inspection is covered too.\n- **`CLAUDE.md`** \u2014 added as rule 5 in the four-rules block (now five).\n- **`operations.okf.md`** \u2014 \"help requested\" in `intake-gap` issues is bounded\n  to document sources.\n- **`betrayal-legacy/scout-report.okf.md`** \u2014 the one instance already on\n  `main` is reworded to request an official component scan/readout only.\n\n## What is deliberately *not* changed\n\nThe underlying evidence gaps stay recorded. Where no lawful document source\nexists, the denominator stays `UNKNOWN`, the record stays `needs_followup`, and\nthe spec now states plainly that this is an accepted terminal state rather than\na pending task. No claim gained confidence it did not have.\n\nThe same removal is applied per-branch in #15, #16, #17, #18 and #19, since\nthose PRs carry their own copies of the ask. #14 had none.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/generate-index.mjs`\n- `node scripts/validate-okf.mjs` \u2014 2,637 files clean + INDEX fresh\n- `node --test scripts/intake-lib.test.mjs scripts/validate-intake-package.test.mjs scripts/fail-closed.test.mjs scripts/validate-okf-provenance.test.mjs` \u2014 45 tests, 44 pass, 1 intentional skip, 0 fail\n- `node scripts/validate-intake.mjs --base origin/main` \u2014 clean\n- Exact-head CI: `validate` **SUCCESS** \u2014 [run 30754891517](https://github.com/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/actions/runs/30754891517/job/91515270291)",
  "closed_at": "2026-08-02T16:50:55Z",
